{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The nuts and washers kit fits my recent interest in keeping useful fasteners on hand for assembly and repair jobs.",
    "An assortment of hardware feels like a plausible next purchase after my screw and locking washer kits, although I would need to check whether the SAE sizes fit my job."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The printer filaments require a specific activity that my recent purchases do not suggest I am doing; buying hardware does not mean I need printing materials.",
    "The thermal camera and thermometer have repair uses, but I have no current inspection or temperature measurement task.",
    "Wire connectors and copper sheets serve different jobs from fastening and hanging, while the tests and face masks do not address my current hardware needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seem to treat a broad connection to tools and workshop supplies as enough reason for me to buy something.",
    "The suggestions assume that interest in practical hardware extends to specialized printing, electrical, and inspection projects."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases cluster around fastening, securing, and hanging things, especially assorted fasteners and magnetic hooks.",
    "Compatibility matters: my recent screws were metric, so an SAE assortment is useful only if its sizes match something I need to assemble or repair.",
    "I rarely choose something just because it might be useful someday; it needs a clear connection to a current need."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly recognized my interest in practical hardware but stretched it into specialized projects I have no current reason to pursue."
}"}
